        <briefdescription>
<para>Does the same thing as <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_do_nothing_memory_s_s_a_walker_1a9da2890c2f44bf0d822421285e9331b6" kindref="member">getClobberingMemoryAccess(const Instruction *I)</ref>, but takes a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_access" kindref="compound">MemoryAccess</ref> instead of an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">Instruction</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
