    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_s_s_a_walker" kindref="compound">MemorySSAWalker</ref> that does no alias queries, or anything else. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It simply returns the links as they were constructed by the builder. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
